<title>USA: USG unit buys Gulf Coast Building Materials.</title>
<headline>USG unit buys Gulf Coast Building Materials.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USG Corp said Tuesday its L&amp;W Supply unit acquired Gulf Coast Building Materials Inc for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Gulf Coast will become part of L&amp;W Supply's building products network in Florida, which includes 28 distribution centers under the Seacoast and Doby-Seacoast Supply names, said USG. L&amp;W Supply has opened 32 centers since 1993.</p>
<p>USG is a manufacturer of such building products as gypsum wallboard, joint compound and acoustical ceilings.</p>
<p>The company's stock was up 7/8 at 32-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
